error[misrefactored_assign_op]: `total += total + ...` applies `+` to `total` twice
  --> tests/lint/misrefactored_assign_op/bad.jai:9:5
   |
 9 |     total += total + 5;
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: `+=` already starts from `total`: write `total += 5`
   |
